* Thu Nov 26 2026 ozzi- <oz@oz-web.com> 0.1.0-13
- Fix scrolling: replace the whole-card tap-to-toggle MouseArea (which grabbed
  every touch, so any scroll starting on a card expanded/collapsed it instead
  of scrolling) with dedicated Expand/Collapse Silica Buttons. Silica Buttons
  hand drags back to the list (DragFilter), so scrolling works from anywhere,
  even from on top of the buttons. Verified on the SFOS 5.1 emulator.

* Thu Nov 26 2026 ozzi- <oz@oz-web.com> 0.1.0-12
- M3a: remote Approve/Deny of tool + directory access — interactive approval
  card with choice buttons in the session view; bridge POST /approve drives
  Bionic's own approval UI over CDP (new bridge/cdp.mjs); client approveChoice()
- Fix approval title/description/labels rendering (unwrap Bionic's
  localizableMessage wrapper); choice-button layout uses a fixed row height
  (Theme.controlHeight does not exist on the Qt 5.6 / Silica stack)

* Sun Nov 16 2026 ozzi- <oz@oz-web.com> 0.1.0-1
